<h2>5. Selected Projects</h2>

<h3>1. Simbli AI — Autonomous Social Media AI Agent</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Category:</b> Autonomous AI Agent · DCI Product Service</li>
  <li><b>Website:</b> <a href="https://www.simbli.ai/">https://www.simbli.ai/</a></li>
  <li><b>Problem:</b> Brands and content teams struggle to track viral topics in real time, generate high-impact posts tailored to each platform, and maintain consistent multi-platform publishing schedules.</li>
  <li><b>What I Built:</b> Built an autonomous social media content generation and scheduled auto-posting AI agent for DCI. The agent detects real-time trending topics, generates platform-optimized posts engineered for maximum reach and engagement upon topic selection, and automatically publishes them at scheduled times across connected social media platforms.</li>
  <li><b>Technologies:</b> Autonomous AI Agent, Trend Discovery, LLM Content Gen, Scheduled Auto-Posting, Social Media APIs, FastAPI, React, DCI Service.</li>
</ul>

